From 90142441e4f0381d821e3fb8ebf0dc45d94068d2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 17:46:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Dashboard card: PNG defaults for hug/touch/miss, 3-dots photo
 menu

- Add hug.png, touch.png, miss.png (1280x720) as default card images
  and remove the old SVGs.
- Replace the camera button with a 3-dots button that opens a small
  menu: "Set my own image" (opens the existing photo editor) and
  "Use default image" (resets the current card to its default).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01W8uaJwGPYzctYsH1NfUyji
---
